{
  "datasets": [
    {
      "name": "ds_claims",
      "displayName": "Claims, policies and customers",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT claim_number, incident_date, incident_type, incident_severity,\n",
        "       claim_amount, claim_date, claim_status, days_to_report,\n",
        "       policy_number, policy_type, policy_effective_date, policy_expiry_date,\n",
        "       premium, sum_insured, deductible,\n",
        "       customer_id, customer_name, customer_city,\n",
        "       claim_to_sum_insured_ratio, incident_within_coverage,\n",
        "       CASE WHEN NOT incident_within_coverage      THEN 'Outside coverage'\n",
        "            WHEN claim_to_sum_insured_ratio > 1    THEN 'Exceeds sum insured'\n",
        "            WHEN days_to_report > 14               THEN 'Reported late'\n",
        "            ELSE 'Clean' END AS review_flag\n",
        "FROM customer_claim_policy_telematics\n",
        "ORDER BY claim_amount DESC"
      ],
      "columns": [
        {
          "displayName": "Total Claims",
          "description": "Number of claims in scope",
          "expression": "COUNT(`claim_number`)"
        },
        {
          "displayName": "Exposure",
          "description": "Total claimed amount",
          "expression": "SUM(`claim_amount`)"
        },
        {
          "displayName": "Outside Coverage %",
          "description": "Share of claims whose incident date falls outside the policy window",
          "expression": "SUM(CASE WHEN `incident_within_coverage` THEN 0 ELSE 1 END) * 1.0 / COUNT(`claim_number`)"
        },
        {
          "displayName": "Over Sum Insured %",
          "description": "Share of claims claiming more than the policy's sum insured",
          "expression": "SUM(CASE WHEN `claim_to_sum_insured_ratio` > 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 1.0 / COUNT(`claim_number`)"
        },
        {
          "displayName": "Avg Days to Report",
          "description": "Mean delay between incident and claim",
          "expression": "AVG(`days_to_report`)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "overview",
      "displayName": "Overview",
      "pageType": "PAGE_TYPE_CANVAS",
      "layoutVersion": "GRID_V1",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "header",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Claims Investigation\n",
                "\n",
                "Every claim in the gold layer, joined to its policy and policy holder. The four tiles below are the ones an adjuster acts on: **how much is being claimed**, and **how much of it fails a basic policy check**. Four in five claims have an incident date outside the policy's effective window, and roughly a third claim more than the sum insured — those are the rows in the review table at the bottom. Use the **Filters** page to scope by date, severity, incident type or policy type; every widget on this page responds."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 12, "height": 3}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "kpi_total_claims",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "measure(Total Claims)", "expression": "MEASURE(`Total Claims`)"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "counter",
              "encodings": {
                "value": {
                  "fieldName": "measure(Total Claims)",
                  "displayName": "Claims",
                  "format": {"type": "number-plain", "abbreviation": "compact", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 1}}
                }
              },
              "frame": {"title": "Total claims", "showTitle": true}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 3, "width": 3, "height": 3}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "kpi_exposure",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "measure(Exposure)", "expression": "MEASURE(`Exposure`)"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "counter",
              "encodings": {
                "value": {
                  "fieldName": "measure(Exposure)",
                  "displayName": "Claimed",
                  "format": {"type": "number-currency", "currencyCode": "USD", "abbreviation": "compact", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 2}}
                }
              },
              "frame": {"title": "Total exposure", "showTitle": true}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 3, "y": 3, "width": 3, "height": 3}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "kpi_outside_coverage",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "measure(Outside Coverage %)", "expression": "MEASURE(`Outside Coverage %`)"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "counter",
              "encodings": {
                "value": {
                  "fieldName": "measure(Outside Coverage %)",
                  "displayName": "Outside coverage",
                  "format": {"type": "number-percent", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 1}}
                }
              },
              "frame": {"title": "Incident outside policy window", "showTitle": true}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 6, "y": 3, "width": 3, "height": 3}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "kpi_over_sum_insured",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "measure(Over Sum Insured %)", "expression": "MEASURE(`Over Sum Insured %`)"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "counter",
              "encodings": {
                "value": {
                  "fieldName": "measure(Over Sum Insured %)",
                  "displayName": "Over sum insured",
                  "format": {"type": "number-percent", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 1}}
                }
              },
              "frame": {"title": "Claim exceeds sum insured", "showTitle": true}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 9, "y": 3, "width": 3, "height": 3}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "section_mix",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {"lines": ["## Claim mix"]}
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 6, "width": 12, "height": 1}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "severity_by_type",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [
                    {"name": "incident_type", "expression": "`incident_type`"},
                    {"name": "incident_severity", "expression": "`incident_severity`"},
                    {"name": "count(claim_number)", "expression": "COUNT(`claim_number`)"}
                  ],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 3,
              "widgetType": "bar",
              "mark": {"layout": "group"},
              "encodings": {
                "x": {"fieldName": "incident_type", "displayName": "Incident type", "scale": {"type": "categorical", "sort": {"by": "value"}}},
                "y": {"fieldName": "count(claim_number)", "displayName": "Claims", "scale": {"type": "quantitative"}},
                "color": {
                  "fieldName": "incident_severity",
                  "displayName": "Severity",
                  "scale": {
                    "type": "categorical",
                    "sort": {"by": "custom-order", "orderedValues": ["Total Loss", "Major Damage", "Minor Damage"]},
                    "mappings": [
                      {"value": "Total Loss", "color": "#FF7054"},
                      {"value": "Major Damage", "color": "#FFA600"},
                      {"value": "Minor Damage", "color": "#99DDB4"}
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Incident severity by incident type"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 7, "width": 7, "height": 6}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "status_mix",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [
                    {"name": "claim_status", "expression": "`claim_status`"},
                    {"name": "count(claim_number)", "expression": "COUNT(`claim_number`)"}
                  ],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 3,
              "widgetType": "pie",
              "encodings": {
                "angle": {"fieldName": "count(claim_number)", "displayName": "Claims", "scale": {"type": "quantitative"}},
                "color": {"fieldName": "claim_status", "displayName": "Status", "scale": {"type": "categorical"}},
                "label": {"show": true}
              },
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Claims by status"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 7, "y": 7, "width": 5, "height": 6}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "exposure_trend",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [
                    {"name": "monthly(incident_date)", "expression": "DATE_TRUNC(\"MONTH\", `incident_date`)"},
                    {"name": "incident_severity", "expression": "`incident_severity`"},
                    {"name": "sum(claim_amount)", "expression": "SUM(`claim_amount`)"}
                  ],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 3,
              "widgetType": "line",
              "encodings": {
                "x": {"fieldName": "monthly(incident_date)", "displayName": "Incident month", "scale": {"type": "temporal"}},
                "y": {
                  "fieldName": "sum(claim_amount)",
                  "displayName": "Claimed",
                  "scale": {"type": "quantitative"},
                  "format": {"type": "number-currency", "currencyCode": "USD", "abbreviation": "compact", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 1}}
                },
                "color": {
                  "fieldName": "incident_severity",
                  "displayName": "Severity",
                  "scale": {
                    "type": "categorical",
                    "mappings": [
                      {"value": "Total Loss", "color": "#FF7054"},
                      {"value": "Major Damage", "color": "#FFA600"},
                      {"value": "Minor Damage", "color": "#99DDB4"}
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Monthly exposure by severity"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 13, "width": 12, "height": 5}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "section_review",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {"lines": ["## Claims needing review\n", "\n", "Everything that failed at least one policy check, largest claim first."]}
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 18, "width": 12, "height": 2}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "review_table",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [
                    {"name": "claim_number", "expression": "`claim_number`"},
                    {"name": "incident_date", "expression": "`incident_date`"},
                    {"name": "customer_name", "expression": "`customer_name`"},
                    {"name": "incident_type", "expression": "`incident_type`"},
                    {"name": "incident_severity", "expression": "`incident_severity`"},
                    {"name": "policy_type", "expression": "`policy_type`"},
                    {"name": "claim_amount", "expression": "`claim_amount`"},
                    {"name": "sum_insured", "expression": "`sum_insured`"},
                    {"name": "claim_to_sum_insured_ratio", "expression": "`claim_to_sum_insured_ratio`"},
                    {"name": "days_to_report", "expression": "`days_to_report`"},
                    {"name": "claim_status", "expression": "`claim_status`"},
                    {"name": "review_flag", "expression": "`review_flag`"}
                  ],
                  "filters": [{"expression": "`review_flag` <> 'Clean'"}],
                  "disaggregated": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "table",
              "encodings": {
                "columns": [
                  {"fieldName": "claim_number", "displayName": "Claim"},
                  {"fieldName": "incident_date", "displayName": "Incident date"},
                  {"fieldName": "customer_name", "displayName": "Policy holder"},
                  {"fieldName": "incident_type", "displayName": "Type"},
                  {"fieldName": "incident_severity", "displayName": "Severity"},
                  {"fieldName": "policy_type", "displayName": "Policy"},
                  {
                    "fieldName": "claim_amount",
                    "displayName": "Claimed",
                    "format": {"type": "number-currency", "currencyCode": "USD", "abbreviation": "compact", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 2}}
                  },
                  {
                    "fieldName": "sum_insured",
                    "displayName": "Sum insured",
                    "format": {"type": "number-currency", "currencyCode": "USD", "abbreviation": "compact", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 2}}
                  },
                  {
                    "fieldName": "claim_to_sum_insured_ratio",
                    "displayName": "Claim / insured",
                    "format": {"type": "number-plain", "decimalPlaces": {"type": "max", "places": 2}},
                    "style": {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "rules": [
                        {"condition": {"operand": {"type": "data-value", "value": "1"}, "operator": ">="},
                         "backgroundColor": {"themeColorType": "visualizationColors", "position": 1}}
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {"fieldName": "days_to_report", "displayName": "Days to report"},
                  {"fieldName": "claim_status", "displayName": "Status"},
                  {"fieldName": "review_flag", "displayName": "Flag"}
                ]
              },
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Flagged claims"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 20, "width": 12, "height": 8}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "filters",
      "displayName": "Filters",
      "pageType": "PAGE_TYPE_GLOBAL_FILTERS",
      "layoutVersion": "GRID_V1",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "filter_incident_date",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "q_incident_date",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "incident_date", "expression": "`incident_date`"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "filter-date-range-picker",
              "encodings": {"fields": [{"fieldName": "incident_date", "displayName": "Incident date", "queryName": "q_incident_date"}]},
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Incident date"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 4, "height": 2}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "filter_severity",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "q_severity",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "incident_severity", "expression": "`incident_severity`"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "filter-multi-select",
              "encodings": {"fields": [{"fieldName": "incident_severity", "displayName": "Severity", "queryName": "q_severity"}]},
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Severity"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 4, "y": 0, "width": 4, "height": 2}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "filter_incident_type",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "q_incident_type",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "incident_type", "expression": "`incident_type`"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "filter-multi-select",
              "encodings": {"fields": [{"fieldName": "incident_type", "displayName": "Incident type", "queryName": "q_incident_type"}]},
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Incident type"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 8, "y": 0, "width": 4, "height": 2}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "filter_status",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "q_status",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "claim_status", "expression": "`claim_status`"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "filter-multi-select",
              "encodings": {"fields": [{"fieldName": "claim_status", "displayName": "Status", "queryName": "q_status"}]},
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Claim status"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 0, "y": 2, "width": 4, "height": 2}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "filter_policy_type",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "q_policy_type",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "policy_type", "expression": "`policy_type`"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "filter-multi-select",
              "encodings": {"fields": [{"fieldName": "policy_type", "displayName": "Policy type", "queryName": "q_policy_type"}]},
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Policy type"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 4, "y": 2, "width": 4, "height": 2}
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "filter_review_flag",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "q_review_flag",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "ds_claims",
                  "fields": [{"name": "review_flag", "expression": "`review_flag`"}],
                  "disaggregated": false
                }
              }
            ],
            "spec": {
              "version": 2,
              "widgetType": "filter-multi-select",
              "encodings": {"fields": [{"fieldName": "review_flag", "displayName": "Review flag", "queryName": "q_review_flag"}]},
              "frame": {"showTitle": true, "title": "Review flag"}
            }
          },
          "position": {"x": 8, "y": 2, "width": 4, "height": 2}
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "uiSettings": {
    "theme": {
      "canvasBackgroundColor": {"light": "#FCFCFC", "dark": "#1F272D"},
      "widgetBackgroundColor": {"light": "#FFFFFF", "dark": "#11171C"},
      "fontColor": {"light": "#11171C", "dark": "#E8ECF0"},
      "selectionColor": {"light": "#2272B4", "dark": "#8ACAFF"},
      "visualizationColors": ["#FFA600", "#FF7054", "#DE5582", "#995495", "#4E5185", "#1D425C", "#99DDB4"],
      "widgetHeaderAlignment": "LEFT"
    }
  }
}
